# SPEC-08 — Style / look / genre

Contract: `docs/spec-references/SPEC-08-style-look.md`. Inherits SPEC-00. Do not build from it until the user feeds this spec.

A selected style chip must stay in the director prompt even when notes are empty. Film-stock buttons write grade and grain. The 20 cube LUT list is unused until a panel calls it. AI grade suggestion is a model call and must stay gated.
